# Shell script line endings

Follow the **Shell scripts (LF only)** standing rule in
[`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). [`.gitattributes`](../../.gitattributes) already
sets `*.sh text eol=lf`.

When creating or editing `*.sh` on Windows: write **LF** only. Before `scp` or
commit, assert zero `\r` bytes in the file. CRLF shebangs fail on Linux as
`env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory`.
